
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head industry-head page-head--art">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">For plumbers &amp; trades</span>
        <h1>When the geyser bursts, be the one who answers.</h1>
        <figure class="ph-art ph-art--phone" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/art/phone-call.webp?v=1" alt="" width="600" height="1005" /></figure>
        <p class="lead">Missed calls, WhatsApps at 11pm and “how much for a geyser?”: answered in seconds, jobs booked into your diary, and real emergencies sent straight to whoever is on call.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.4rem">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-plumbers-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
          <a href="live-demo?sample=calls" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large">See it answer one</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Rather message? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="painTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Where the day goes</span><h2 id="painTitle">The messages that eat your day.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--3">
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span><h3>Calls you can’t take</h3><p>You’re under a sink. The call goes to voicemail, and the customer calls the next plumber on Google.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span><h3>Quotes typed at night</h3><p>Every “how much for…?” needs a reply with your call-out and rates, written after a full day on site.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span><h3>Emergencies mixed in with admin</h3><p>A burst pipe at 6am sits in the same inbox as a newsletter. The urgent ones need to reach you first.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="setTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">What we&rsquo;d set up</span>
          <h2 id="setTitle">AI drafts the reply. You stay in charge.</h2>
          <ul class="tick-list">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Missed calls and WhatsApps answered, with a job card filled in</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Routine jobs offered a slot from your diary, with an SMS to confirm</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Emergencies sent to the on-call person straight away</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Quote replies drafted from your call-out fee and rates</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Optional: a fast website with tap-to-call and a quote tool</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1rem">It answers only from your own prices and rules. Anything it isn&rsquo;t sure about goes to a person.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="card card--link work-card reveal" href="live-demo?sample=calls">
          <div class="work-card__body">
            <div class="work-card__meta"><span class="badge badge--concept">Live demo</span><span class="tag tag--muted">Sample work, nothing is sent</span></div>
            <h3>A missed call, turned into a booked job</h3>
            <p>A caller’s geyser isn’t heating. The job card is filled in, a slot booked and an SMS ready for the customer.</p>
            <div class="card__foot"><span class="card__more">Run it yourself</span></div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="priceTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">What it costs</span><h2 id="priceTitle">A fixed price before anything starts.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--2 industry-pricing">
          <ul class="price-list reveal">
            <li><div class="pl-name">Message and enquiry assistant<small>Replies drafted from your prices and diary, on WhatsApp and your website</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R25,000</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Keeping it running<small>We look after it, keep it accurate and send a monthly time-saved report</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R7,500<span class="per">/mo</span></span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Customer email first?<small>The Inbox Assistant drafts routine email replies, R1,500 deposit, the rest only once it saves 5 hours a week</small></div><span class="price"><small>setup</small>R9,500</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Add a website<small>Prices, gallery, Book and WhatsApp buttons</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R12,500</span></li>
          </ul>
          <div class="card card--tint reveal">
            <h3>Not sure it&rsquo;s worth it?</h3>
            <p>That&rsquo;s what the free call is for. Tell us roughly how many messages and calls you get. We&rsquo;ll tell you honestly whether AI would save real hours, and if not, we&rsquo;ll say so.</p>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.8rem">Prices are starting points for typical plumbers. Your quote is fixed before we begin. <a class="inline-link" href="pricing">Full price list &rarr;</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="howTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h2 id="howTitle">From first call to answered messages.</h2></div>
        <ol class="steps reveal">
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">1</span><h3>Free 30-minute call</h3><p>You tell us what comes in and what eats your day. We say honestly whether AI fits.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">2</span><h3>Fixed quote</h3><p>Exactly what it will do and what it costs. Nothing starts until you&rsquo;ve said yes.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">3</span><h3>Tested on real messages</h3><p>It drafts replies to your real enquiries first, so you see it working before it goes live.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">4</span><h3>Running, and measured</h3><p>We look after it and send you the time it saved each month.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Questions plumbers ask</span><h2 id="faqTitle">Straight answers.</h2></div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Does it talk to my customers by itself?</summary><p>Only where you choose. Many trades start with drafts and job cards for the office to send; routine bookings can go out automatically later.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>What about real emergencies?</summary><p>Anything urgent, a burst pipe, a gas smell, no power, goes to the on-call person immediately, not into a queue.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>I get my work from word of mouth. Do I need this?</summary><p>Word of mouth still ends in a call or a WhatsApp. This makes sure that call gets answered, even when you can’t.</p></details>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1.2rem">More in the <a class="inline-link" href="pricing#faq">general FAQ</a>. Also for: <a class="inline-link" href="for-salons">Hair &amp; beauty salons</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-restaurants">Restaurants &amp; takeaways</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-cleaners">Cleaning services</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <span class="cta__services">For plumbers &amp; trades</span>
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">Tell us what takes too long.</h2>
        <p>A free 30-minute call. You leave with a rough price, or an honest &ldquo;not worth it&rdquo;.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a class="btn btn--light btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-plumbers-book-end">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Rather message? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
